{
  "file_id": "ID03557",
  "text_count": 117,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������We made it to Hikarigaoka in one\npiece.",
      "_offset": 2167,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Good thing the bus dropped us off\nhere.",
      "_offset": 2215,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Yamato, Takeru, that was an\namazing performance!",
      "_offset": 2255,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "\"It was the last place we could be\nhappy together before our parents\ndivorced...\"",
      "_offset": 2304,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Even I totally believed it!",
      "_offset": 2386,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "But the camp bus wouldn't drop us\noff here unless we said that.",
      "_offset": 2414,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "The Hikarigaoka apartment complex\nis huge! It's like a castle!",
      "_offset": 2478,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "It's not a castle. All kinds of\ndifferent people live separately\nin those apartments.",
      "_offset": 2541,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Huuuuuuh?!",
      "_offset": 2627,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Humans are so interesting!",
      "_offset": 2638,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Did you live in Hikarigaoka too,\nSora?",
      "_offset": 2665,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Yeah.",
      "_offset": 2704,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Sora and I were in the same class.\nThird Elementary School, class\n1-2!",
      "_offset": 2710,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "I went to Fourth Elementary.",
      "_offset": 2781,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "I went to Fifth...",
      "_offset": 2810,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Me too! I was in kindergarten...",
      "_offset": 2829,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "So was I! It was only for a short\ntime, though...",
      "_offset": 2862,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Whaaaaaat?",
      "_offset": 2912,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "*All* of us lived in Hikarigaoka?",
      "_offset": 2923,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "I don't think this is just a\ncoincidence.",
      "_offset": 2957,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Anyway, back to Vamdemon. He's\nalready made the first move.",
      "_offset": 2999,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Maybe not...",
      "_offset": 3059,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "What makes you think that,\nKoushirou?",
      "_offset": 3072,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "The flow of time is different\nbetween the two worlds. If\nVamdemon came here...",
      "_offset": 3110,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "...only a minute or so should have\npassed between his arrival and\nours.",
      "_offset": 3189,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Oh!",
      "_offset": 3261,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "So if we hurry, we might beat\nVamdemon's army to the eighth\nchild?",
      "_offset": 3265,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Okay, let's look for them!",
      "_offset": 3332,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "PicoDevimon, Tailmon, take this.",
      "_offset": 3359,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Ah!",
      "_offset": 3392,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Go on! Take it!",
      "_offset": 3396,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Hmph! So patronizing. What's this?",
      "_offset": 3412,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "It's a copy of the eighth child's\nCrest.",
      "_offset": 3447,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "What about the real one?",
      "_offset": 3488,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "It's in my possession. But the\ncopy will still react if the\neighth child is near.",
      "_offset": 3513,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "You must find the eighth child at\nany cost.",
      "_offset": 3595,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Yes, sir!",
      "_offset": 3639,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Yes, sir!",
      "_offset": 3649,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "You might not remember it well,\nTakeru, but we used to play a lot\naround here.",
      "_offset": 3659,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "But it still feels pretty\nnostalgic.",
      "_offset": 3738,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "How long did you live here,\nKoushirou?",
      "_offset": 3775,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "I believe it wasn't even a year.",
      "_offset": 3814,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Must have been because of that\nterrorist bombing.",
      "_offset": 3847,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Bombing?",
      "_offset": 3897,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Terrorists?",
      "_offset": 3906,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "You guys might not remember this,\nbut there was a terrorist attack\nhere four years ago.",
      "_offset": 3918,
      "_length": 87,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "They never caught the culprit, so\nmy parents moved away. They\nthought it was too dangerous here.",
      "_offset": 4006,
      "_length": 96,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Right, it was the same for my\nfamily. They said something about\na bombing.",
      "_offset": 4103,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Come to think of it, I feel like\nsomething similar happened with my\nfolks.",
      "_offset": 4178,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "_offset": 4253,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Ah! Is that one of Vamdemon's\nDigimon?",
      "_offset": 4258,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "That's Mammon!",
      "_offset": 4297,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "This is bad! We have to stop him!",
      "_offset": 4312,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Ahahaha! We did it!",
      "_offset": 4346,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "People can actually see Vamdemon's\nDigimon...",
      "_offset": 4366,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Giant monsters...",
      "_offset": 4412,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "What'd you say, Takeru?",
      "_offset": 4430,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "I remember! Back when we lived \nhere, Takeru got scolded for \nsaying he saw giant monsters!",
      "_offset": 4454,
      "_length": 91,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Could that have been...",
      "_offset": 4546,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "...the so-called bombings!",
      "_offset": 4570,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "This is definitely where the\nterrorist bombings took place!",
      "_offset": 4597,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "It felt exactly like this!",
      "_offset": 4657,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Yeah. They were fighting, then\nthis and that happened...",
      "_offset": 4684,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "(What I saw that day...wasn't a\ngiant monster.)",
      "_offset": 4741,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Koromon... Koromon, what happened?",
      "_offset": 4789,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "W-whoa...",
      "_offset": 4824,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "*sob* Koromon... Koromoooooooon!",
      "_offset": 4834,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Koromon...",
      "_offset": 4867,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Hikari, gimme your whistle!",
      "_offset": 4878,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Taichi?",
      "_offset": 4906,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Get him!",
      "_offset": 4914,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Greymon! That's right, it was\nGreymon!",
      "_offset": 4923,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "You're right...",
      "_offset": 4962,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "That day, a Koromon came to our\nhome, and that Koromon became an\nAgumon.",
      "_offset": 4978,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "And then it became a Greymon, and\nfought with another Digimon.",
      "_offset": 5051,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "After the fight, they both\ndisappeared...",
      "_offset": 5114,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "So it wasn't a terrorist attack!",
      "_offset": 5156,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "So you met Taichi back then,\nKoromon?",
      "_offset": 5189,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "It must have been a different\nKoromon!",
      "_offset": 5227,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "But when I first met Taichi, I had\nthis really nostalgic feeling...",
      "_offset": 5266,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "This is bad! We're gonna get\ncaught, and they're gonna ask a\nlot of questions!",
      "_offset": 5334,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "R-ruuuuuun!",
      "_offset": 5413,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "*pant* *pant* I think we're far\nenough.",
      "_offset": 5425,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Yeah.",
      "_offset": 5465,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "I always thought it was strange.",
      "_offset": 5471,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Out of all the children who went\nto camp, why were we the only ones\nchosen?",
      "_offset": 5504,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "But today, we've found the key to\nthis mystery.",
      "_offset": 5580,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "The incident from four years\nago...",
      "_offset": 5628,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Yes. What we have in common is\nthat we all met the Digimon four\nyears ago.",
      "_offset": 5664,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "So the eighth child did, too?",
      "_offset": 5739,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "I'm sure they must have seen the\nincident.",
      "_offset": 5769,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "So does that mean Vamdemon's\nalready found them? They're in\nHikarigaoka, right?",
      "_offset": 5812,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Since Mammon was wandering around\nhere all alone...",
      "_offset": 5892,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "...the others are all prolly\nwand'rin' around lookin' for the\neighth child!",
      "_offset": 5944,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "We'll find them! We'll find the\neighth child before they do!",
      "_offset": 6020,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "But where do we look?",
      "_offset": 6081,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "There's one other thing we have in\ncommon...",
      "_offset": 6103,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "We all moved from Hikarigaoka...",
      "_offset": 6148,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Yes. It can't be a coincidence, so\nwe should assume that the eighth \nchild has also moved.",
      "_offset": 6181,
      "_length": 90,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "So the eighth child is in Odaiba?",
      "_offset": 6272,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "I wanna go hooooooome!",
      "_offset": 6306,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "All right! In that case, let's\nhead back to Odaiba!",
      "_offset": 6329,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "Why is there an elephant in\nHikarigaoka?",
      "_offset": 6381,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "They must be making a movie, or\nsomething!",
      "_offset": 6422,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 6465,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Gyaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 6479,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Taichi! We have to do something\nabout Mammon, right now!",
      "_offset": 6491,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "You're right, let's go!",
      "_offset": 6548,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "Let's go!",
      "_offset": 6572,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 6582,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "Roooooooooar!",
      "_offset": 6588,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "All right, Koromon! Evolve!",
      "_offset": 6602,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Got it!",
      "_offset": 6630,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "Koromon, evolve!",
      "_offset": 6638,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
